# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Getting there

step Nijel's Point
  zone Desolace
  tip Follow the road west past Sun Rock Retreat (Horde) and south-west through the Charred Vale into Desolace; Nijel's Point stands at the top of the pass.
  getfp "Nijel's Point" npc 6706      -- Baritanas Skyriver
  sethome "Nijel's Point" npc 11103   -- Innkeeper Lyshaerya
  turnin 1453                         -- Kreldig Ungor
  accept 1458
  accept 1387                         -- Corporal Melkins
  accept 1437                         -- Vahlarriel Demonslayer
  accept 97284                        -- Vahlarriel Demonslayer: the Burning Blade in Thunder Axe Fortress, where her search leads

step Malem chest
  tip The chest lies in the ruins south-west of Nijel's Point.
  turnin 1437                         -- Malem Chest
  accept 1465

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North-east

step Sargeron
  tip The Hatefury satyrs hold the ruins of Sargeron, east of Nijel's Point.
  tip Careful: Hatefury Rogues spawn stealthed, and Hatefury Tricksters have a poison proc on their attacks.
  collect 6246 quest 1458.1           -- Hatefury Claw
  collect 6247 quest 1458.2           -- Hatefury Horn

step Kreldig Ungor
  turnin 1458
  accept 1459

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Desolace: the west

step Nijel's Point
  zone Desolace
  turnin 1465
  accept 1438

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thunder Axe Fortress

step Azore Aldamort
  tip Azore's tower stands on the hill west of Thunder Axe Fortress: take his quest first, the sceptre he wants is in the fortress.
  accept 5741

step Dalinda Malem
  tip Dalinda hides inside the Burning Blade's fortress south-west of Nijel's Point.
  turnin 1438                         -- Inside
  accept 1439

step Tyranis and the Seer
  tip Her brother Tyranis (36) walks the fortress with the Burning Blade cultists (30-33): pull him alone. The Burning Blade Seer keeps the sceptre in the fortress's main building. Vahlarriel wants four of each kind of cultist on the way.
  collect 6767 quest 1439             -- Tyranis' Pendant; inside
  collect 15750 quest 5741            -- Sceptre of Light; on the top floor
  kill 4663 quest 97284.1             -- Burning Blade Augur
  kill 4664 quest 97284.2             -- Burning Blade Reaver
  kill 4665 quest 97284.3             -- Burning Blade Adept
  kill 4666 quest 97284.4             -- Burning Blade Felsworn

step Escort Dalinda
  turnin 1439                         -- Dalinda Malem, inside
  accept 1440
  goto 58.3,30.9 "Out of Thunder Axe Fortress"
  note Lead Dalinda out of the fortress; she walks off once you are clear of it. Vahlarriel takes the turn-in at Nijel's Point at the end of the guide.
  complete 1440

step Smeed Scrabblescrew
  tip Smeed's camp is on the road south of Kolkar Village, by the Kodo Graveyard.
  accept 5561

step Kodo Graveyard
  tip Use Smeed's Kodo Kombobulator on an Aged, Dying or Ancient Kodo: it becomes a tamed kodo that follows you. Walk it back to Smeed's camp; there, talk to the kodo: that counts it and lets you tame the next. Five kodos, one at a time; Aged Kodos also drop the hides, and the Scorpashi Lashers that hunt around the graveyard carry the venom.
  use 13892 @51.0,58.5 "Kodo Kombobulator" -- on an Aged, Dying or Ancient Kodo in the graveyard; don't kill it
  talk 4700 quest 5561.1 @60.6,61.6   -- the tamed kodo, at Smeed's camp: talk to it, five times
  collect 6249 quest 1459.2
  collect 6248 quest 1459.1           -- Scorpashi Venom

step Smeed Scrabblescrew
  turnin 5561

